From 1f925c2e18dd15f84beb7ae3872cc659e1742dfb Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Totto16 <tobiausgais@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 6 Sep 2026 21:12:28 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 4/4] feat: make the stdlib thread safe in some places - make
 malloc thread safe - add mutex support, using the C11 interface, not pthread
 - make certain IO operations thread safe

